{"t":"MAA","n":"Mid-America Apartment Communities, Inc.","nKo":"미드아메리카 아파트 커뮤니티즈(Mid-America Apartment Communities, Inc.)","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":113.19,"chg":0.28,"chgPct":0.00248,"prev":112.91,"dayH":113.53,"dayL":111.71,"w52H":144.41,"w52L":111.71,"vol":1405554,"avgVol":942100,"mcap":13460918272,"pe":34.3,"fpe":34.51,"eps":3.3,"feps":3.28,"pb":2.48,"div":6.12,"divY":0.0541,"beta":0.7,"short":4758725,"shortPct":0.0412,"shortRatio":4.55,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Real Estate","sKo":"부동산","i":"REIT - Residential","iKo":"REIT - 주거용","city":"Germantown","emp":2507,"web":"https://www.maac.com","sum":"Mid-America Apartment Communities, Inc. is a real estate investment trust (REIT) focused on delivering full-cycle and superior investment performance for shareholders through the ownership, management, acquisition, development and redevelopment of quality apartment communities primarily in the Southeast, Southwest and Mid-Atlantic regions of the United States. As of September 30, 2026, MAA had ownership interest in 105,136 apartment units, including communities in development, across 16 states and the District of Columbia. Mid-America Apartment Communities, Inc. was incorporated in 1977 in Tennessee and is based in Germantown, Tennessee.","sumKo":"Mid-America Apartment Communities, Inc.는 주로 미국 남동부, 남서부 및 중부 대서양 지역의 고품질 아파트 커뮤니티의 소유권, 관리, 인수, 개발 및 재개발을 통해 주주들에게 전체 주기 및 우수한 투자 성과를 제공하는 데 중점을 둔 부동산 투자 신탁(REIT)입니다. 2026년 9월 30일 현재 MAA는 16개 주와 컬럼비아 특별구에 걸쳐 개발 중인 커뮤니티를 포함해 105,136개의 아파트 유닛에 대한 소유권을 보유하고 있습니다. Mid-America Apartment Communities, Inc.는 1977년 테네시에서 설립되었으며 테네시 주 저먼타운에 본사를 두고 있습니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":2019866000,"ni":633748000},{"y":2023,"rev":2148468000,"ni":549118000},{"y":2024,"rev":2191015000,"ni":523855000},{"y":2025,"rev":2209126000,"ni":443221000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":555556000,"ni":56649000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":553725000,"ni":123437000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":555127000,"ni":120828000},{"q":"3Q2026","rev":56013000